        "Name": "Mapping neuroinflammation in vivo with diffusion-MRI in rats given a systemic lipopolysaccharide challenge",
        "ReferencesAndLinks": null
      },
      "readme": "Thirty-two male Sprague Dawley rats were treated with LPS (0.5 mg/kg) or saline vehicle (1 ml/kg) and scanned 24 hours later. T2-weighted images and multi-shell diffusion MRI data were acquired on a 9.4T Bruker BioSpec 94/20.\n\nThis dataset has been converted using BrkRaw (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3818615) at 2022-10-07 18:12:45.343116.\n## How to cite?\n - https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bbi.2023.07.010\n",
